From db137a15733f381b1e50f858d242b29f6bab92c8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: n64player <n64player@live.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 17:18:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Android port: rebase Waterdish's Android changes onto this
 libultraship

Ports the Android-specific changes from Waterdish/libultraship (as used by
Shipwright-Android 9.0.2) to the restructured src/ship, src/fast and include/
layout: touch/virtual gamepad JNI glue, gyro via phone sensors, custom ImGui SDL2
backend (rebuilt on ImGui 1.91.9b), Android menu toggling, UI scaling and
external storage paths.
